# Bootstrap first: no assignments, even empty ones. Cloudflare would require them before deployment.
# 首次先部署：此文件仅包含注释；即使空赋值也会变成 Cloudflare 部署前的必填项。
# With no configuration, only /setup is available; application routes return 503.
# 未配置时仅 /setup 可用；业务接口返回 503。
# After deployment, open /setup, generate fresh credentials, and create your own GitHub OAuth App.
# 部署后打开 /setup 生成初装凭据，并创建自己的 GitHub OAuth App。
# In the Worker dashboard add GITHUB_CLIENT_ID, GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET, BRIDGE_SEAL_KEY and DEVICE_REGISTRY as Secrets.
# 在 Worker 控制台中添加上述四项 Secrets；同时按指南设置三个普通变量，先保持上传关闭。
# Keep real values out of this file. See docs/deployment.md or docs/zh-CN/deployment.md.
